  "editorial_notes": [
    "Realm and family membership stay unchanged. The displayed order is a teaching and colour-composition choice, not measured scent distance.",
    "Two or three familiar comparisons and two optional feel words replace longer lists. Colour-only, abstract spatial and physiological prompts are omitted.",
    "Solar / Airy becomes Airy Floral for this edition, with Hedione as the reference. Warm sunscreen is omitted to keep one clear character in the fixed row budget.",
    "Javanol moves from Sheer Wood to Creamy Wood; Iso E Super remains under Sheer Wood.",
    "Mineral / Saline keeps the original Marine branch but uses a comparison accord rather than treating ambery/woody Cetalox as an exact saline standard.",
    "C18 is identified as coconut lactone; C14 shorthand becomes peach lactone. PEA, IBQ and Abs abbreviations are expanded.",
    "Tonka / Almond combines related directions: coumarin suggests sweet hay; benzaldehyde suggests almond/cherry kernel. Paired labels do not mean synonyms.",
    "Materials are learning references, not ingredient identifications or complete descriptions. Smell varies with concentration and context.",
    "Smell comparisons and feel words are editorial prompts, not claims that every reader must perceive each association."
